The files in this directory, and in ../atoms, are vendored from
beautifului.dev by Turbo and are used under the MIT License.

Two files carry local edits, both commented in place:
  records-table.tsx  adds a `labels` prop for the column headings
  tool-chips.tsx     hides the file diff strip when no diffs are passed

